    [1229] = {name = "Grimoire of Create Soulstone", additional_info = "Classes: Warlock\nRequires Level 18\n[q2]Use: Teaches Create Soulstone.\n[q2]Creates a Minor Soulstone. The Soulstone can be used to store one target's soul. If the target dies while their soul is stored, they will be able to resurrect with 400 health and 700 mana.\n\n Conjured items disappear if logged out for more than 15 minutes.\nSell Price: 5 50\nMinor Soulstone\nConjured Item\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\n[q2]Use: Stores the friendly target's soul. If the target dies while his soul is stored, he will be able to resurrect with 400 health and 700 mana.\nRequires Soul Shard"},
