    [22222] = {name = "[q3]Plans: Thick Obsidian Breastplate", additional_info = "Requires Blacksmithing (300)\n[q2]Use: Teaches you how to make a Thick Obsidian Breastplate.\nSell Price: 2\n[q4]Thick Obsidian Breastplate\nBinds when equipped\nChest Plate\n929 Armor\n+38 Strength\n+16 Stamina\nDurability 165 / 165\nRequires Level 60\n[q2]Equip: When struck by a non-periodic damage spell you have a 30% chance of getting a 6 sec spell shield that absorbs 300 to 500 of that school of damage. (Proc chance: 30%, 10s cooldown)\nSell Price: 5 64 66\nRequires Large Obsidian Shard (18), Small Obsidian Shard (40), Enchanted Thorium Bar (12), Essence of Earth (10), Huge Emerald (4)"},
